        "item_4U3Ah3": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Timeframe and conditions",
            "text": "<p>You have <strong>14 days</strong> from receiving your order to request a return — no reason required, in accordance with the right of withdrawal established by EU consumer protection law (Directive 2011/83/EU). For us to accept the item back, it must be unworn, unwashed, with all original tags attached, and in its original packaging.</p><p>When trying on underwear, please follow general hygiene practices and wear it over your own underwear.</p><p>If an item is returned to us showing signs of use — including but not limited to: odour, makeup marks, stretched elastic, signs of washing, or damage — we reserve the right to refuse a refund. In this case, we will send the item back to you at your expense, or, if you do not cover the return shipping cost within 10 days, we reserve the right to dispose of the item.</p>",
            "heading_color": "secondary"
          }
        },
        "item_Trn7qX": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Exchanges",
            "text": "<p>We don't offer direct exchanges: if you need a different size, colour, or style, the fastest way is to return the item that doesn't work and place a new order for what you need.</p>",
            "heading_color": "secondary"
          }
        },
        "item_YDGU4D": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "If the item was a gift",
            "text": "<p>Only the person who paid for the order can request a return — that is, the purchaser, not the gift recipient. If you gave the item as a gift and need to return something, please contact us or log into your account and start a return.</p><p>A gift card that hasn't been used yet can be refunded within 14 days of purchase. If the gift card has already been used to pay for an order, any refund for that order will be issued as a new gift card.</p>",
            "heading_color": "secondary"
          }
        },
        "item_awc9jT": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How to make a return",
            "text": "<p>Everything is done through your account on bymello.eu. Find the relevant order under \"My Orders\" and select \"Request a return\" — mark the items you'd like to return and state the reason. Once confirmed, we'll prepare a return label for you via Omniva. Simply pack the item, attach the return label (covering the original one), and drop the parcel off at an Omniva parcel locker. <strong>Returns are free of charge.</strong></p><p>We process refunds within <strong>10 business days</strong> of receiving and inspecting the returned item, to the same payment method used for the original order.</p>",
            "heading_color": "secondary"
          }
        },
        "item_4Mebwi": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "If your item arrived faulty or isn't what you ordered",
            "text": "<p>In this case, there's no need to file a standard return — just email us at <a href=\"mailto:hello@bymello.eu\">hello@bymello.eu</a> with your order number and a photo of the item. We'll prioritize your case and offer a replacement or refund.</p><p>Faulty items are covered by a <strong>2-year statutory warranty</strong> under EU law (Directive 1999/44/EC).</p>",
            "heading_color": "secondary"
